// Kerberoasting via RC4 Service Ticket Request
// Detects Kerberoasting by flagging RC4-encrypted (etype 0x17) TGS requests for user-account SPNs. Roasting tools force RC4 because it cracks far faster than AES.
// techniques: T1558.003   severity: high
// source: rules/credential-access/kerberoasting-rc4-tgs.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
SecurityEvent
| where ((((EventID =~ "4769") and (TicketEncryptionType =~ "0x17") and (TicketOptions =~ "0x40810000")) and not ((ServiceName endswith "$"))) and not ((ServiceName =~ "krbtgt")))
